# sweep: --bare
# The reference itself: every category, paging a long list, filters, search,
# bookmarks, the edition switch, a monster sent to initiative, and the
# bookmarks and edition surviving a restart.
wait-for Grimoire
tap Spells
expect Acid Arrow
expect 1 of 64
tap-id next
expect 2 of 64
tap-id previous
expect 1 of 64
# A level and ritual narrow the list; Clear filters lets them all go.
tap Filters
tap Level
expect Show only
tap Level 1
expect Level 1
tap Ritual
tap Yes
expect Yes
tap View results
expect Alarm
expect-missing Acid Arrow
clean
shot spells-level-ritual
tap Filters
tap Clear filters
tap View results
expect Acid Arrow
expect 1 of 64
# A search narrows by the start of a name, and Back lets go of it first.
tap Search
expect Type the start of a name.
type fire
tap-id kb.enter
expect Fire Bolt
expect Fireball
expect-missing Acid Arrow
clean
shot spells-search
# A spell opens in the reader.
tap Fireball
wait-idle
expect Level 3 · Evocation · Sorcerer, Wizard
expect 20-foot-radius sphere
clean
shot spell-fireball
tap-id 4294967295
wait-idle
expect Fire Bolt
tap-id 4294967295
expect Acid Arrow
# A search with no match says what to change.
tap Search
type zzq
tap-id kb.enter
expect No matching reference
tap-id 4294967295
expect Acid Arrow
# The row menu bookmarks a reference, and Bookmarks lists it.
tap-id entry-menu-1030
expect Bookmark
clean
shot spell-row-menu
tap Bookmark
tap Bookmarks
expect Acid Arrow
clean
shot bookmarks-one
tap Acid Arrow
wait-idle
expect A shimmering green arrow
tap-id 4294967295
wait-idle
expect Bookmarks
expect Acid Arrow
# Back from Bookmarks returns to the list it was opened from.
tap Back
expect Filters
expect Acid Arrow
# The 2024 reference has no spells, and says so rather than blaming a filter
# or offering filters for a list with nothing in it.
tap 2024
expect No spells in the 2024 reference
expect switch edition above
expect-missing Filters
clean
shot spells-2024
tap-id 4294967295
tap Monsters
expect Aboleth
# The edition and the bookmark are kept across a restart.
restart
wait-for Grimoire
tap Spells
expect No spells in the 2024 reference
tap 2014
expect Acid Arrow
tap Bookmarks
expect Acid Arrow
tap Back
tap-id entry-menu-1030
expect Remove bookmark
tap Remove bookmark
tap Bookmarks
expect No bookmarks
expect Bookmark a reference to keep it here.
tap Back
tap-id 4294967295
# Monsters filter by challenge and type, and one can join the initiative.
tap Monsters
tap Filters
tap Challenge rating
tap Above 0 through 1
tap Monster type
tap-id filters-next
tap Humanoid
tap View results
expect Acolyte
expect Medium humanoid · CR 1/4
expect 2 filters on
clean
shot monsters-filtered
tap Search
type gob
tap-id kb.enter
expect Goblin
expect Names starting "gob" · 2 filters on
tap-id entry-menu-800
expect Add to initiative
tap Add to initiative
tap-id 4294967295
tap-id 4294967295
tap Initiative
expect Goblin
expect HP 7/7
tap-id 4294967295
# Rules and conditions, and magic items.
tap Rules & conditions
expect Blinded
tap Blinded
wait-idle
expect can't see
tap-id 4294967295
wait-idle
tap-id 4294967295
tap Magic items
expect Adamantine Armor
clean
shot magic-items
tap-id 4294967295
# A stat block is written for a reader, not as the source data's fields.
tap Monsters
tap Search
type gob
tap-id kb.enter
tap Goblin
wait-idle
expect Nimble Escape
clean
shot monster-goblin
expect-missing url: /api
expect-missing AC type:
expect 15 (leather armor, shield)
expect 1/4 (50 XP)
